Queue Baikal live fan updates outside sgminer API thread.

The BK-B live fan hook previously called BAIKAL_SET_OPTION synchronously
from ascset/set_device. Auto Fan can call this path periodically, so doing
USB send/read work inside the API request can wedge the API thread.

Queue the requested fan percentage from ascset and let the Baikal result
polling master apply it later from the normal driver path. Normal fan changes
are rate-limited and coalesced; 100% emergency requests bypass the interval.

